  "description": "AbpWebhooks: signed outgoing webhooks for an ABP app on .NET 10 and EF Core. A queue in the application's own database, delivery ids that stay the same however often an event is heard, a worker on each server that claims, POSTs and signs each delivery (X-Webhook-Signature, HMAC-SHA256 of the timestamp and body), retries after 1, 5 and 15 minutes, 1 and 4 hours, and prunes; redelivery on request; and the receiver's check. The application keeps its webhooks, what it sends and who may see it.",
